    {
      "source": "Create a <a href=\"FilteredClassLoader.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.test.context\"><code>FilteredClassLoader</code></a> that hides resources from the given\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/io/ClassPathResource.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.io\"><code>classpath resources</code></a>.",
