    {
      "source": "Create a <a href=\"FilteredClassLoader.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.test.context\"><code>FilteredClassLoader</code></a> that filters based on the given predicate.",
      "translation": "创建一个<a href=\"FilteredClassLoader.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.test.context\"><code>FilteredClassLoader</code></a>，根据给定的谓词进行过滤。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>hiddenClasses</code> - the classes to hide",
      "translation": "<code>hiddenClasses</code> - 要隐藏的课程",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>filters</code> - a set of filters to determine when a class name or resource should\nbe hidden. A <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/function/Predicate.html#test(T)\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.function\"><code>result</code></a> of <code>true</code> indicates a\nfiltered class or resource. The input of the predicate can either be the binary\nname of a class or a resource name.",
      "translation": "<code>filters</code> - 一组过滤器，用于确定何时隐藏类名或资源。如果 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/function/Predicate.html#test(T)\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.function\"><code>result</code></a> 为 <code>true</code>，则表示该类或资源已被过滤。谓词的输入可以是类的二进制名称或资源名称。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/net/URLClassLoader.html#getResourceAsStream(java.lang.String)\" title=\"class or interface in java.net\">getResourceAsStream</a></code> in class <code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/net/URLClassLoader.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.net\">URLClassLoader</a></code>",
